>> Combination := Lista bag-o.

Combination kon: ['idugang-sa-tumoy:'] buhata: { :el
	kaugalingon 
	pangitaa: el, Wala? tinuod: { kaugalingon idugang-sa-tumoy: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination bag-o.
colours
	idugang-sa-tumoy: ['red'],
	idugang-sa-tumoy: ['green'],
	idugang-sa-tumoy: ['blue'],
	idugang-sa-tumoy: ['red'].

Gawas isulat: colours, bag-ong-linya.
